*       B1c minimal witness (FINDING-2026-08-19-s164 "e_plain"): a deferred function call inside an EVAL-BUILT pattern.
*       Sibling b1c_m_plain.sno spells the identical pattern MAIN-built and is the passing control.
        DEFINE('PC()')  :(PCe)
PC      OUTPUT = 'PC ran'        :(RETURN)
PCe     P = EVAL("'x' *PC()")
        S = 'x'
        S POS(0) P      :S(Y)F(N)
Y       OUTPUT = 'match'         :(END)
N       OUTPUT = 'nomatch'
END
